# nucleo_grove_farm — umbrella-subsystem activation (option A).
#
# Assembly: 1x seeed_grove_base_v2 (pure copper carrier, no Kconfig of its
# own) + 1x grove_sens_bme280 (bosch,bme280 over I2C) + 1x grove_btn
# (gpio-keys) + 1x grove_light (ADC light sensor, L4-ADC item 35). Checked
# against the driver Kconfig (zephyr-rigs), same umbrellas
# grove_sens_pinned_defconfig and lotus_buttons_defconfig already
# establish for the first two shields, and lotus_pwm_defconfig for the
# third:
#   - SENSOR is a bare `if SENSOR` menuconfig gate (drivers/sensor/Kconfig)
#     with no default; RTC_PCF8523-style dt_compat_enabled auto-select
#     cannot reach through it, so the rig opens it explicitly
#     (grove_sens_pinned_defconfig's own CONFIG_SENSOR=y, unchanged here).
#   - INPUT is likewise a bare `menuconfig` (subsys/input/Kconfig, default
#     n); INPUT_GPIO_KEYS defaults to y once INPUT is on and
#     DT_HAS_GPIO_KEYS_ENABLED, and selects GPIO transitively
#     (lotus_buttons_defconfig's own CONFIG_INPUT=y/CONFIG_GPIO=y, listed
#     explicitly below for the same clarity that file gives).
#   - ADC is likewise a bare umbrella (drivers/adc/Kconfig), no
#     dt_compat_enabled auto-select of its own (lotus_pwm_defconfig's own
#     CONFIG_ADC=y, unchanged here) -- grove_light's own vnd,light-sensor
#     compatible carries no real driver (dts/bindings/test/), so this
#     umbrella is what a --build-only twister run actually needs.
CONFIG_SENSOR=y
CONFIG_INPUT=y
CONFIG_GPIO=y
CONFIG_ADC=y
